{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214040","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1321404001:1":{"text":"Hello, young man. Are you from the Kalev family?","source_cn":"小朋友，你是卡洛夫家的人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A9D6FA5DADB8787","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321404002:1":{"text":"How did you know?\nYou don't seem like you're from Cedartown.","source_cn":"你们会怎么知道？\\n……你们也不像是雪松镇的人啊。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB4D9F41D9DC5FD88","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How did you know?\nYou don't seem like you're from Cedartown.","female":"How did you know?\nYou don't seem like you're from Cedartown.","variant_male_record_index":"148691","variant_female_record_index":"148692","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321404003:1":{"text":"Have you ever heard of the Kaminsky family?","source_cn":"你听说过卡明斯基家族吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BC2C588444CC27F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321404004:1":{"text":"Hmm... I think my older brother mentioned them once. They're supposed to be our distant relatives.","source_cn":"唔，我听我哥哥提起过，好像是关系很远的亲戚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA9B68FA252A6DC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321404005:1":{"text":"Are you from the Kaminsky family?","source_cn":"难道你们是那个家族的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27BB438E61AA0DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1321404005":{"text":"Are you from the Kaminsky family?","source_cn":"难道你们是那个家族的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27BB438E61AA0DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321404006:1":{"text":"Okay... Well, I only know that their family is somehow connected to our family. That's about it.","source_cn":"好吧！不过，我只知道卡明斯基好像是我们家的亲戚，其余就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0118DF11FDC37F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321404007:1":{"text":"You could ask my brother. He went out this morning to go see the hero's <style=\"highlight\">ice sculpture</style>.","source_cn":"要不然，你们还是去问我哥哥吧！他早上出门去看<styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D018192DF737680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321404008:1":{"text":"Oh, so he must admire Val... I mean, he must admire the general, then.","source_cn":"咦？他很崇拜瓦——呃，很崇拜那位女将军吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB7F031191B6BC80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321404009:1":{"text":"I guess so. Every time he's in a bad mood, he goes to see her.","source_cn":"嗯……我猜是吧？反正他心情不好的时候就会去看英雄冰雕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB428CC31AB5278A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321404010:1":{"text":"If you're going to find him, can you take me with you? He hasn't come home for a bit, and I want to talk to him.","source_cn":"你们要去找他的话，可以带上我吗？他一直没回家，我想去找他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x970AD49DB1F66682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321404011:1":{"text":"Yeah, sure. We can take you to him.","source_cn":"那好吧，你就跟我们一起去吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E67C6C73C6DE15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"We're looking for their descendants.","source_cn":"我们在找卡明斯基的后裔","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE9ED9AAEDDD323C4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We're looking for their descendants.","female":"We're looking for their descendants.","variant_male_record_index":"69346","variant_female_record_index":"69347","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"I'm not confirming or denying.","source_cn":"你可以当我们是","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0E1F2D41B3D42080","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm not confirming or denying.","female":"I'm not confirming or denying.","variant_male_record_index":"69348","variant_female_record_index":"69349","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小彼得":{"text":"Peter","source":"小彼得","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}